
===========================================================================
=============== Electron-Phonon-System with Green-Functions ===============
===========================================================================


We consider the model Hamiltonians

    H = H_el + H_ph + H_int

with

 - H_el  = epsilon_z * (n_up - n_down)
 - H_ph  =     Omega * b^dagger * b

 - H_int = 0                                        (non-interacting case)
 - H_int = g_int * (n_up + n_down) + (b^dagger + b) (    interacting case)

+=========+
|| Tasks ||
+=========+

 -             Plotting the Chemical Potential mu(T)
 - Computing & Plotting the Number of Electrons <N_el>(T) (should be constant)
 - Computing & Plotting the Number of States N_states(T) (should be constant)
 - Computing & Plotting the Density Of States DOS(T)
 - Computing & Plotting the Magnetization M_z(T)


+====================+
|| Model Parameters ||
+====================+

 - Magnetic Field Strength           B = 10.000 Tesla
 - Zeeman-Energies         +-epsilon_z = +- 0.580 meV
 - Phonon Energy                 Omega = 10.0 meV
 - Electron-Phonon Coupling:     g_int = 5.0 meV


+==========================+
|| Convergence Parameters ||
+==========================+

 - Regularization-Parameter        eta = 0.01 meV
 - Interval for the Integrations:    I = [30.0, 30.0] meV


+=====================================================+
|| Doing the computations for different Temperatures ||
+=====================================================+


===========================================================================

T = 0.0 K

 - Searching for the root of a monotonically increasing function.
 - The interval in which we expect the root is J = [-6.0, 6.0] meV.
 - The determined value mu = -0.816 meV yields <N>(mu) = 1.000
 - The normalization condition is fulfilled if N_states = 2 = 2.000
 - The Magnetization along the z-axis for the interacting system reads 
    <\mu_z> / < g.s. | \mu_z | g.s. > = 0.672
 - The Magnetization along the z-axis for the non-interacting system reads 
    <\mu_z>_0 / < g.s. | \mu_z | g.s. > = 0.989
 - The Magnetization (analytical expression) along the z-axis for the non-interacting system reads 
    <\mu_z>_0 / < g.s. | \mu_z | g.s. > = 1.000 

